          "settings": {
            "tier_title": "Hardcore Track & Race",
            "tier_intro": "<p>Track-focused fitments for drivers chasing lap times, where performance comes before convenience. Expect to run aftermarket suspension, additional negative camber, and trimmed or aftermarket fender liners for clearance at full lock.</p>",
            "a_label": "Staggered",
            "a_front": "18x10 ET12",
            "a_rear": "18x11 ET15",
            "a_image": "shopify://shop_images/IMG_0553.jpg",
            "a_notes": "A fully race-oriented fitment for the G8X chassis. The 18\" diameter increases sidewall for grip, compliance, and consistency under hard driving. The 18x11 ET15 rear is a direct bolt-on with a strong, planted stance, while the 18x10 ET12 front pushes the platform's limits and requires slight caliper clearance to properly seat the wheel. Best suited for track-focused builds where performance takes priority over convenience.",
